Music for BuzzOS

Desktop music player with WAV and MP3 support through the native AC97
driver. Bundled samples:

  /share/buzzos-demo.mp3
  /share/buzzos-demo.wav

Open a file from the File Manager, or pass a path as the app argument.

Controls:
  Space       play or pause
  R           restart from the beginning
  S           stop and rewind
  Click bar   seek to a position

Supported:
  MP3   MPEG-1/2 Layer III (decoded with minimp3)
  WAV   PCM 8/16-bit, mono or stereo

Playback is converted to unsigned 8-bit mono at 11025, 22050, or 44100 Hz.
